## Installation

**Prerequisites:** Python 3.14+, PostgreSQL (the app's own database — there is no development instance to start), direnv{% if has_frontend %}, Node.js 22+, pnpm{% endif %}

```bash
git clone git@github.com:poodle64/{{ project_name }}.git
cd {{ project_name }}
direnv allow
cp backend/.env.example backend/.env   # set POSTGRES_PASSWORD and friends
uv run --project backend alembic upgrade head
```

```bash
uv run --project backend uvicorn {{ package_name }}.server:app --reload --port {{ backend_port }}   # backend
{% if has_frontend -%}
pnpm -C frontend dev   # frontend, http://localhost:{{ frontend_port }}
{% endif -%}
```

